    "name": "Yubico YubiCloud OTP Validation API",
    "description": "YubiCloud is Yubico's hosted web service for verifying Yubico One-Time Passwords (OTPs) generated by a YubiKey.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Yubico Developer Program",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
